<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" identifier="diagnostic-with-penalty" title="诊断练习与错答扣分">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="ACTION" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"><qti-correct-response><qti-value>Adapt</qti-value></qti-correct-response></qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RATIO" cardinality="single" base-type="float"><qti-correct-response><qti-value>75</qti-value></qti-correct-response></qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float"/>
  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-rubric-block view="candidate" use="instructions"><qti-content-body><p>两个空均可留空，漏答不计分。行动答对得 2 分，答错扣 1 分；比例为 75 得 2 分、绝对误差不超过 1 得 1 分，其余数值扣 0.5 分。每空只计一次。</p></qti-content-body></qti-rubric-block>
    <p>收到具体反馈后，应当<qti-inline-choice-interaction response-identifier="ACTION"><qti-label>学习行动</qti-label><qti-inline-choice identifier="Adapt">调整策略</qti-inline-choice><qti-inline-choice identifier="Ignore">忽略反馈</qti-inline-choice></qti-inline-choice-interaction>。</p>
    <p>20 份资源中 15 份通过复核，通过率为 <qti-text-entry-interaction response-identifier="RATIO" placeholder-text="填写百分数"/> %。</p>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if><qti-is-null><qti-variable identifier="ACTION"/></qti-is-null><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-sum><qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-sum></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
      <qti-response-else-if><qti-match><qti-variable identifier="ACTION"/><qti-correct identifier="ACTION"/></qti-match><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-sum><qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/><qti-base-value base-type="float">2</qti-base-value></qti-sum></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else-if>
      <qti-response-else><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-sum><qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/><qti-base-value base-type="float">-1</qti-base-value></qti-sum></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if><qti-is-null><qti-variable identifier="RATIO"/></qti-is-null><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-sum><qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-sum></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
      <qti-response-else-if><qti-equal><qti-correct identifier="RATIO"/><qti-variable identifier="RATIO"/></qti-equal><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-sum><qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/><qti-base-value base-type="float">2</qti-base-value></qti-sum></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else-if>
      <qti-response-else-if><qti-equal tolerance-mode="absolute" tolerance="1"><qti-correct identifier="RATIO"/><qti-variable identifier="RATIO"/></qti-equal><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-sum><qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-sum></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else-if>
      <qti-response-else><qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-sum><qti-variable identifier="SCORE"/><qti-base-value base-type="float">-0.5</qti-base-value></qti-sum></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>
